<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic
        SYSTEM "https://resources.jetbrains.com/writerside/1.0/xhtml-entities.dtd">
<topic xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://resources.jetbrains.com/writerside/1.0/topic.v2.xsd"
       title="/mass-sync" id="mass-sync">

    <tldr>
        <p>
            <format style="italic">Queue many users for role/nickname syncing.</format>
        </p>

        <p><br/></p>

        <p>
            <format style="bold">Allowed in DMs:</format>
            :x: No
        </p>

        <p>
            <format style="bold">Default permission required:</format>
            <code>Administrator</code>
        </p>
    </tldr>

    <chapter title="Description" id="description">
        <p>
            This command allows you to queue many users for role/nickname syncing. This queue is server-based, where one
            user is synced every 15 seconds to avoid Discord rate limits.
        </p>
        <p>
            Common use cases for mass-sync include:
        </p>
        <list>
            <li>After adding or modifying <a href="Role-Management.md">role requirements</a>, to apply the new rules to all members</li>
            <li>To update outdated stats (Catacombs level, SkyBlock level, etc.) in nicknames and roles when users have progressed in-game but haven't manually run <a href="sync.topic">/sync</a></li>
            <li>After updating guild membership on Hypixel, to sync guild-based roles</li>
            <li>To refresh all nicknames and roles after configuration changes</li>
        </list>
        <p>
            Users must have a <a href="link.topic">linked Minecraft account</a> for syncing to apply game-based roles and
            requirements. Unlinked users will only have their basic Discord roles updated.
        </p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Sub-Commands" id="sub-commands">
        <list>
            <li><a href="mass-sync-role.topic"/>: Add members of a role (or @everyone) to the sync queue.</li>
            <li><a href="mass-sync-guild.topic"/>: Add members of a Hypixel guild to the sync queue.</li>
            <li><a href="mass-sync-list.topic"/>: Show number of users currently queued.</li>
            <li><a href="mass-sync-clear.topic"/>: Clear the current queue.</li>
        </list>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="See Also" id="see-also">
        <list>
            <li><a href="force-sync.topic"/>: single-user alternative.</li>
            <li><a href="link.topic"/>: make sure users are linked before syncing.</li>
            <li><a href="Verification.md"/>: the verification feature is described closer here.</li>
        </list>
    </chapter>

</topic>
